<title>USA: Cra Managed to withdraw share sale.</title>
<headline>Cra Managed to withdraw share sale.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CRA Managed Care Inc said it will withdraw its registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to sell 500,000 company shares and 1.5 million shares by shareholders.</p>
<p>The company filed the registration statement on November 7. CRA officials were not available to comment on the company's action.</p>
<p>Shares of CRA rose as much as 6 1/4 in midmorning trading on the news. They last traded up 5 1/2, at 48.</p>
</text>
